Subject: [PATCH 12/18] Add SGSR 2 upscaler backend for Vulkan

Ports the DX11/DX12 backend to Vulkan with the same HLSL. glslang can't
declare a storage image of unknown format, so build_vk.sh patches the
SPIR-V for the game's output, whose format isn't known up front.

